# tests/gates/controls/OMEGA-GATE-ANCHOR.controls: controls the OMEGA-GATE-ANCHOR step must report as
# "CONTROL OMEGA-GATE-ANCHOR/<name> FAILED_AS_REQUIRED" (kernel/fix3-anchor: tools/gate_anchor.sh); tests/gates/run.sh step_verdict fails the step
# when one is missing, and tools/gate_claims_lint.sh accepts [ctl:OMEGA-GATE-ANCHOR/<name>] for a name listed here.
edited
deleted
renamed-out
mode-changed
type-changed
added-in-folder
list-entry-dropped
list-deleted
script-edited
bad-entry
staged
worktree-edit
worktree-mode
untracked-in-folder
ack-subset
ack-superset
ack-without-change
git-dir-knob
replace-ref
shallow
no-git
no-base
head-copy-weakened
control-run-never-passes
